<title>MEXICO: Mexico's Madisa dividend 0.10 peso/shr.</title>
<headline>Mexico's Madisa dividend 0.10 peso/shr.</headline>
<dateline>MONTERREY, Mexico 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Maquinaria Diesel (Madisa) announced on Tuesday that it will pay a dividend of 0.10 peso per share in a one-time payment from May 29.</p>
<p>In a statement published in local media, Madisa said the payment will be made on the machine company's 68.6 million outstanding shares.</p>
<p>((--Jacqueline Lerma, Monterrey bureau +528 3457677))</p>
